  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Whenever someone drops a portal for people to go through, I've noticed it counts the standalone Quest users as one person, but it counts anyone else as 16-25 people who don't have \"Quest\" under their name.  It ends up making the portal disappear after a couple of people go through and this is an issue for a group who want to go through altogether, typically more than just 2-3 friends or so.  We either have to drop the portal multiple times, request off of the people who made it through, or even go to an instance and start inviting people individually.  This started happening after the first new features started rolling out.",
